{"5326250":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Guild Master","steam_appid":5326250,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your guild. Your adventure. Solo or with friends.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Master<\/strong> is an old-school RPG where you run a growing guild of adventurers. Gather, craft, farm, fight, loot and explore, making your own way through a fantasy world or heading out with friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is ore to mine, supper to cook, and another road calling beyond the trees. Send one hero to gather, set another to work at the forge, then take a third out exploring. The others carry on with the jobs you gave them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your guild keeps busy<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to ten heroes and switch between them as their skills grow. Turn a handful of adventurers into a working guild: miners supply the smiths, fishers feed the cooks, and everyone contributes to a shared bank. Follow the action yourself or let your crew get on with their assignments.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/94a3018fe2154ede5ea692168230135a.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/94a3018fe2154ede5ea692168230135a.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/94a3018fe2154ede5ea692168230135a.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the next road<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander from the little settlement of Sunmeadow into autumn woodland, fishing villages, pine-covered heights, and forgotten ruins. Meet the people who live there, help restore their landmarks, and follow quests that unlock new routes and recipes. Keep an eye out for hidden curios, clue trails, and collections along the way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/f41f5ac97c393f7066c80620a8fc23d5.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/f41f5ac97c393f7066c80620a8fc23d5.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/f41f5ac97c393f7066c80620a8fc23d5.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make something worth coming home for<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop timber, mine ore, cast a line, and turn your haul into tools, equipment, meals, and workshop goods. Train 23 skills, grow crops in gardens across the world, and build a supply chain that supports your next adventure. Upgrade your guild hall, forge, store, and kitchen as your camp grows with you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/be47a30c81884b8f46c0c04cb173f683.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/be47a30c81884b8f46c0c04cb173f683.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/be47a30c81884b8f46c0c04cb173f683.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight, loot, and face the flame<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your heroes, pack their meals, and hunt the frontier's wildlife for useful loot. Turn the spoils of your adventures into better equipment and supplies for the next challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then put your whole guild's work to the test against Ashwake, the Cinder Crown, a deadly fire-breathing dragon. Prepare five adventurers to fight together as Vanguard, Warden, Striker, Scout, and Mender. Every blade, piece of armour, and packed meal has a purpose. Win dragon scales and a trophy to bring home to your camp.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/db5a6791fa24431e4eb9cfd28875a3fe.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/db5a6791fa24431e4eb9cfd28875a3fe.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/db5a6791fa24431e4eb9cfd28875a3fe.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your guild with friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a guild for up to four players through Steam. Each visitor takes control of an available hero in the host’s crew to gather, craft, farm and fight alongside you. Invite Steam friends or share your lobby code. Recruit enough heroes for everyone to have one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host manages recruitment, quests and buildings, and saves the shared guild’s progress. Visitors keep their own solo guilds separate; characters and loot stay in the host’s world. The session ends when the host leaves.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A guild at your pace<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay for another expedition or step away while your plans take shape. Background jobs keep your crew working as you switch heroes, and offline progress catches up for up to eight hours when you return.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather. Craft. Farm. Fight. Loot. Explore. Make it your guild.<\/h2>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your guild. Your adventure. Solo or with friends.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Master<\/strong> is an old-school RPG where you run a growing guild of adventurers. Gather, craft, farm, fight, loot and explore, making your own way through a fantasy world or heading out with friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is ore to mine, supper to cook, and another road calling beyond the trees. Send one hero to gather, set another to work at the forge, then take a third out exploring. The others carry on with the jobs you gave them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your guild keeps busy<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to ten heroes and switch between them as their skills grow. Turn a handful of adventurers into a working guild: miners supply the smiths, fishers feed the cooks, and everyone contributes to a shared bank. Follow the action yourself or let your crew get on with their assignments.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/94a3018fe2154ede5ea692168230135a.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/94a3018fe2154ede5ea692168230135a.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/94a3018fe2154ede5ea692168230135a.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the next road<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander from the little settlement of Sunmeadow into autumn woodland, fishing villages, pine-covered heights, and forgotten ruins. Meet the people who live there, help restore their landmarks, and follow quests that unlock new routes and recipes. Keep an eye out for hidden curios, clue trails, and collections along the way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/f41f5ac97c393f7066c80620a8fc23d5.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/f41f5ac97c393f7066c80620a8fc23d5.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/f41f5ac97c393f7066c80620a8fc23d5.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make something worth coming home for<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop timber, mine ore, cast a line, and turn your haul into tools, equipment, meals, and workshop goods. Train 23 skills, grow crops in gardens across the world, and build a supply chain that supports your next adventure. Upgrade your guild hall, forge, store, and kitchen as your camp grows with you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/be47a30c81884b8f46c0c04cb173f683.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/be47a30c81884b8f46c0c04cb173f683.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/be47a30c81884b8f46c0c04cb173f683.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight, loot, and face the flame<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your heroes, pack their meals, and hunt the frontier's wildlife for useful loot. Turn the spoils of your adventures into better equipment and supplies for the next challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then put your whole guild's work to the test against Ashwake, the Cinder Crown, a deadly fire-breathing dragon. Prepare five adventurers to fight together as Vanguard, Warden, Striker, Scout, and Mender. Every blade, piece of armour, and packed meal has a purpose. Win dragon scales and a trophy to bring home to your camp.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/db5a6791fa24431e4eb9cfd28875a3fe.poster.avif?t=1793713509\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/db5a6791fa24431e4eb9cfd28875a3fe.webm?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/extras\/db5a6791fa24431e4eb9cfd28875a3fe.mp4?t=1793713509\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your guild with friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a guild for up to four players through Steam. Each visitor takes control of an available hero in the host’s crew to gather, craft, farm and fight alongside you. Invite Steam friends or share your lobby code. Recruit enough heroes for everyone to have one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host manages recruitment, quests and buildings, and saves the shared guild’s progress. Visitors keep their own solo guilds separate; characters and loot stay in the host’s world. The session ends when the host leaves.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A guild at your pace<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay for another expedition or step away while your plans take shape. Background jobs keep your crew working as you switch heroes, and offline progress catches up for up to eight hours when you return.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather. Craft. Farm. Fight. Loot. Explore. Make it your guild.<\/h2>","short_description":"An old-school RPG where you run the whole guild solo or with friends. Gather, craft, farm, fight, loot and explore with a growing crew. Switch heroes while the others keep working, turn shared supplies into better gear, and prepare your adventurers to face a deadly fire-breathing dragon.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/636b509283ea16710df3070799ac17e0fbf456d5\/header.jpg?t=1793713509","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/076faba991e9840ffa1db22ee6c95378d7300282\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793713509","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/076faba991e9840ffa1db22ee6c95378d7300282\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793713509","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i3 4th Gen \/ AMD FX-8300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 1GB Video Memory<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> N\/A<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Recoil Mojo"],"publishers":["Mojo Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$9.99"},"packages":[1840580],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Guild Master","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1840580,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Guild Master - $9.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/39ed26f9cf9f3aa88edfbda63e9c530e73a2bd8e\/ss_39ed26f9cf9f3aa88edfbda63e9c530e73a2bd8e.600x338.jpg?t=1793713509","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/39ed26f9cf9f3aa88edfbda63e9c530e73a2bd8e\/ss_39ed26f9cf9f3aa88edfbda63e9c530e73a2bd8e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793713509"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/431c867378e9ba4b9b1e7a9898e1fae017cfeaa1\/ss_431c867378e9ba4b9b1e7a9898e1fae017cfeaa1.600x338.jpg?t=1793713509","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/431c867378e9ba4b9b1e7a9898e1fae017cfeaa1\/ss_431c867378e9ba4b9b1e7a9898e1fae017cfeaa1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793713509"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/a12b9d9cbf0262af7f068b08b291939214814c24\/ss_a12b9d9cbf0262af7f068b08b291939214814c24.600x338.jpg?t=1793713509","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/a12b9d9cbf0262af7f068b08b291939214814c24\/ss_a12b9d9cbf0262af7f068b08b291939214814c24.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793713509"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/99f2eb8d37f8ae512a182cbf1833ade578068e2a\/ss_99f2eb8d37f8ae512a182cbf1833ade578068e2a.600x338.jpg?t=1793713509","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/99f2eb8d37f8ae512a182cbf1833ade578068e2a\/ss_99f2eb8d37f8ae512a182cbf1833ade578068e2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793713509"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5326250\/1d63fed5eb268